the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-delegated-nondeterministic-expression.ruml".

child 1 of Stichprobe ausgewählt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 1 holds for the case.

child 2 of Stichprobe ausgewählt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 2 holds for the case.

child 3 of Stichprobe ausgewählt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 3 holds for the case.

